# Only the docs site deploys from this vercel.json. Keep the API service, its
# fixtures, and every secret out of the upload — but curriculum/ and docs/ must
# stay, because the sync script reads them at build time.
#
# Do NOT ignore /storefront. Both Vercel projects share this repo; the
# storefront project has Root Directory = storefront, and a root .vercelignore
# that drops /storefront deletes the app before its ignoreCommand can run.
#
# Leading slashes matter: a bare "src" would also match website/src.
/src
/scripts
/evals
/data
# The Python track is participant-only: nothing here is installed or executed
# by any Vercel build. Excluded per-subdirectory rather than as a bare
# /python, because python/labs/deltas.md IS published as a doc and sync-docs
# reads it at build time — ignoring the parent would take the file with it.
/python/triage
/python/evals
/python/.venv
/python/*.egg-info
/python/pyproject.toml
/.devcontainer
/node_modules
/scratch
.env
.env.local
website/node_modules
website/build
website/.docusaurus
